    - target: {fileID: 7115644861783451543, guid: 163d1702966a08e4d889eacfee19179a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: '1. Download and install the compatible HiBoP Quest version on your
        headset.


        2. Launch HiBoP on Quest and keep the headset awake.


        3.
        For Wi-Fi, connect both devices to the same network. USB discovery is also
        available.


        4. Automatic: select a detected Quest. Manual: enter
        the headset IP address.


        5. Click Connect and enter the six-digit
        code shown in Quest when requested.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
